---
import { skills } from '../data/portfolio';
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---
<section id="about" class="border-b border-line/60"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-14 px-5 py-24 lg:grid-cols-[.9fr_1.1fr] lg:px-8"><div><SectionHeading icon="♟" eyebrow="System profile" title="System Profile" /><p class="mt-8 text-xs leading-6 text-slate-400">I am a systems architect with over a decade of experience designing and deploying mission-critical infrastructure for enterprise-scale applications.</p><p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-6 text-slate-400">My core philosophy is built around automation, observability, and zero-trust security architectures. I believe that infrastructure should be invisible to the user but absolutely rock-solid beneath the surface.</p></div><div class="border border-line bg-panel/60 p-6"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-lime">Core capabilities</p><ul class="mt-5 grid gap-4 text-xs text-slate-300">{skills.slice(0, 4).map((skill, i) => <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-lime">{['◉','◉','◉','◉'][i]}</span>{skill}</li>)}</ul></div></div></section>
<section class="border-b border-line/60"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-24 lg:px-8"><SectionHeading icon="⌁" eyebrow="Architecture matrix" title="Architecture Matrix" copy="I work across the product surface, from interfaces people use to the services and tools that power them." /><div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><article class="border border-line bg-panel/60 p-5"><span class="font-mono text-2xl text-cyan">&lt;/&gt;</span><h3 class="mt-8 font-mono text-sm text-white">Frontend</h3><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-400">Interactive, accessible interfaces with a focus on performance and clear user experiences.</p><span class="mt-5 block font-mono text-[9px] text-lime">DETAILS PENDING</span></article><article class="border border-line bg-panel/60 p-5"><span class="font-mono text-2xl text-cyan">{ }</span><h3 class="mt-8 font-mono text-sm text-white">Backend</h3><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-400">Reliable APIs, data flows, and services designed for maintainability and scale.</p><span class="mt-5 block font-mono text-[9px] text-lime">DETAILS PENDING</span></article><article class="border border-line bg-panel/60 p-5"><span class="font-mono text-2xl text-cyan">AI_</span><h3 class="mt-8 font-mono text-sm text-white">AI CLI</h3><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-400">Command-line tools that bring practical AI workflows closer to the developer.</p><span class="mt-5 block font-mono text-[9px] text-lime">DETAILS PENDING</span></article><article class="border border-line bg-panel/60 p-5"><span class="font-mono text-2xl text-cyan">▣</span><h3 class="mt-8 font-mono text-sm text-white">Mobile Apps</h3><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-400">Mobile applications built around useful flows, thoughtful interaction, and dependable behavior.</p><span class="mt-5 block font-mono text-[9px] text-lime">DETAILS PENDING</span></article></div></div></section>
